=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {n:Behsa Alehgo} at (J-7/J-8) in {z:Eastern Adoulin} at the priory (near the castle) for a cutscene.
* Head to the {p:Scouts' Coalition} and talk to {n:Wegellion} at (F-9) for a cutscene.
** If he gives the option to hand over the hat, do that then talk again to get the cutscene.
* Head to the {p:Frontier Station} at (J-8) in {z:Yorcia Weald} and talk to {n:Emjook-Renook} for a cutscene.
* {n:Emjook-Renook} said he lost his {k:Unblemished pioneer's badge} at one of the following locations (J-8), (H-9), and (I-8).
* Check the **Suspicious Places** at (J-8), (H-9), and (I-8) to obtain the {k:Unblemished pioneer's badge}. Only one of them will have the item.
** (J-8): South west corner of J-8.
*** Head south east from the {p:Frontier Station} into J-9.
*** You'll see a bunch of {m:Bronzecap} and when you reach the fork, take the path to the right (S, not SE) until you see {m:Saptrap}.
*** Turn right, and then right again, passing some {p:Twitherym}, and that will put you into the bottom left corner of J-8. The target is behind a tree.
*** A bush (used to) possibly obstruct this from 00:00 - 6:00.
** (H-9): South west corner at H-9.
*** Head north west from {p:Bivouac} #2.
*** A {p:Colonization Reive} will be in the way.
** (I-8): Located in the field of Numbing Blossoms towards the south side of (I-8).
*** Head east from the Suspicious Place at H-9 (NW from #2) and go north-east towards the {z:Cirdas Caverns} entrance.
*** A bush may obstruct this except from 21:00 - 3:00.
* Return to {n:Emjook-Renook} for a cutscene.
* Speak with {n:Behsa Alehgo} for the final cutscene and your reward.

